    "title": "1 injured in shooting on E. Waldburg Street - NewsBreak",
    "text": "SAVANNAH, Ga. (WSAV) — Police are investigating after a man was injured in a shooting on E. Waldburg Street, the Savannah Police chief said Wednesday night. The man was shot several times, Chief Lenny Gunther said during a briefing held at the Oglethorpe Mall. This marks the second shooting to occur on Wednesday after t hree people were shot at the Oglethorpe Mall. Anyone with information should call CrimeStoppers at 912-234-2020 , or use the SPD mobile app to remain anonymous. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WSAV-TV.",
